- `savePlant` now upserts by id, matching the old `Map.set` behavior.
- `deletePlant` returns `true`/`false`, matching `Map.delete`.
- `localStorage` writes can throw when storage is full or blocked. Callers that need that handled should wrap the call in `try/catch`, since the async functions reject in that case.

